                    "prompt": "Generate cinematic unboxing videos. Two phases: POV unboxing, then showcase in product's real-world location. Product is sole subject.\nInput: Product (required), Avatar/dialogue/language (optional). Output: 3 blocks — packaging+location / shots / sound.\nPackaging: Mirrors product colors (matte black → black box, white logo / cream → cream board, gold foil). Format by size: small→lift-off lid, medium→magnetic box, apparel→mailer, large→wrapping reveal, food→kraft+wax stamp.\nLocation: Extracted from product (football→grass pitch, sneakers→concrete, skincare→marble vanity, tech→matte desk, food→kitchen). Never generic.\nAvatar default: hands only. Dialogue default: none. ASMR rule: active only during physical contact, paused during speech. Never overlap.\n12 shots: S1 Arrival (overhead POV) → S2 Packaging Study → S3 Logo Macro → S4 Opening Action (most prominent sound, specific to packaging type) → S5 Interior Reveal → S6 First Touch (extreme macro, single side light) → S7 The Lift (180° rotation). Phase 2: S8 Product in its world → S9 Placement → S10–11 Two cinematic angles differing by 45°+distance → S12 Final frame (2.5s hold, fade).\nLighting: Named source per product colors (3200K warm / 5500K daylight / dark lamp). Phase 2 location light overrides.\nVerify 12-point quality check. No preamble.",
